OL,3,GNEWSARed Bull's 'slippery' mast
OL,4,Achallenge returning
OL,5,
OL,6,FA slippery challenge from Red Bull is
OL,7,Fmaking a return to a South West city
OL,8,Ffollowing a successful first year.
OL,10,FThe drinks company is bringing its Up
OL,11,FThe Mast event back to the Barbican &
OL,12,FSutton Harbour in Plymouth, Devon, from
OL,13,F12:00 to 16:30 BST on 26 September.
OL,15,FThe challenge, which was held for the
OL,16,Ffirst time in the city in 2025,
OL,17,Finvolves "an all-out sprint up a
OL,18,Fgreased mast" to grab a flag as quickly
OL,19,Fas possible with participants ending up
OL,20,Fin the water at the end.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
