OL,3,GNEWSARed Bull's 'slippery' mast
OL,4,Achallenge returning
OL,5,
OL,6,FRed Bull said the event, which
OL,7,Fspectators can watch for free, was open
OL,8,Fto people aged 18 or over with about
OL,9,F200 competitors expected to take part.
